{"id":"chatcmpl-fc330a60-a4ff-4ef9-b7d6-19d68a4ca533","object":"chat.completion","created":1795229755,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"{\n  \"highlights\": \"Successful visual question answering on medical images benefits from consulting multiple independent expert models and cross-validating their outputs. The approach uses domain-specific tools for initial analysis and a general VLM for confirmation, then synthesizes agreement into a final answer. This reduces reliance on a single model's potential bias or error.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When a visual question requires identifying a specific finding among options, query a domain-specific expert model first to get a focused analysis.\",\n    \"Cross-validate the initial finding with an independent general-purpose VLM to confirm consistency and reduce single-model error.\",\n    \"For tasks involving laterality or spatial relationships, explicitly ask each model to report the side or location to ensure alignment.\",\n    \"If multiple models agree on the same answer, accept it with high confidence; if they disagree, consider additional evidence or a tie-breaking strategy.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical Imaging Analysis\": \"Use specialized medical imaging models for initial interpretation, then confirm with a general VLM. Pay attention to laterality and anatomical orientation.\",\n    \"Visual Question Answering with Options\": \"Decompose the question into a clear query for each model, ensuring the options are explicitly mentioned. Compare outputs for agreement.\",\n    \"Multi-Model Consensus\": \"Leverage agreement between independent models as a confidence signal. Design queries to be unambiguous and directly address the decision.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm that each model's response directly addresses the question and specifies the finding (e.g., right vs. left).\",\n    \"Check for agreement between models; if they disagree, re-evaluate the image or consult a third source.\"\n  ]\n}"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":446,"total_tokens":793,"completion_tokens":347,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":446},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":347}}}